{"id":"torrey:anointing-of-the-holy-spirit","source":"torrey","name":"Anointing Of The Holy Spirit","slug":"anointing-of-the-holy-spirit","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is from God — 2Co 1:21.","refs":[["2Cor",1,21,1,21]]},{"text":"Foretold. — Ps 45:7; Isa 61:1; Da 9:24.","refs":[["Ps",45,7,45,7],["Isa",61,1,61,1],["Dan",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"Fulfilled. — Lu 4:18,21; Ac 4:27; 10:38; Heb 1:9.","refs":[["Luke",4,18,4,18],["Luke",4,21,4,21],["Acts",4,27,4,27],["Acts",10,38,10,38],["Heb",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"God preserves those who receive — Ps 18:50; 20:6; 89:20-23.","refs":[["Ps",18,50,18,50],["Ps",20,6,20,6],["Ps",89,20,89,23]]},{"text":"Saints receive — Isa 61:3; 1Jo 2:20.","refs":[["Isa",61,3,61,3],["1John",2,20,2,20]]},{"text":"Is abiding in saints — 1Jo 2:27.","refs":[["1John",2,27,2,27]]},{"text":"Guides into all truth — 1Jo 2:27.","refs":[["1John",2,27,2,27]]},{"text":"Typified — Ex 40:13-15; Le 8:12; 1Sa 16:13; 1Ki 19:16.","refs":[["Exod",40,13,40,15],["Lev",8,12,8,12],["1Sam",16,13,16,13],["1Kgs",19,16,19,16]]}],"refCount":20}
